# Under Melting a Snow-Covered Island is a nonsnow basic land, so Arcum's Weathervane can't take snow from it but can make it
# snow; the Weathervane's effect, later than Melting's static ability, applies after it in layer 4 and the land is snow
# (CR 613.1d, 613.7a).
